      "content": "<div style=\"\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f7fa 0%, #fff9c4 100%);\n    padding: 20px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    border: 2px solid #ffeb3b;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n\">\n\n<!-- 装饰性背景SVG -->\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.2;\">\n    <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#ffeb3b\" />\n        <g stroke=\"#ffeb3b\" stroke-width=\"4\">\n            <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"0\" />\n            <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"100\" />\n            <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"50\" />\n            <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"50\" />\n            <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"14\" />\n            <line x1=\"79\" y1=\"79\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"86\" />\n            <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"79\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"86\" />\n            <line x1=\"79\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"14\" />\n        </g>\n    </svg>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n        <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/开心\" width=\"80\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0; color: #f57c00; font-size: 24px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n            哇！主人主人！✨\n        </h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; color: #558b2f; font-weight: bold;\">\n            今天的天气确实超级棒呢！阳光明媚得像主人的笑容一样！\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); padding: 15px; border-radius: 15px; border-left: 5px solid #ffa000;\">\n    <div style=\"color: #455a64; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 16px;\">\n        看到这么好的阳光，粽子感觉动力值瞬间 <b>MAX</b> 啦！<br>\n        窗外的云朵像棉花糖一样，微风也吹得人心痒痒的~ <br><br>\n        <span style=\"color: #d32f2f; font-weight: bold;\">严谨的粽子建议：</span><br>\n        这么好的天气，非常适合：\n        <ul style=\"margin: 5px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n            <li>去公园散步，感受大自然！🌿</li>\n            <li>在窗边喝一杯粽子亲手调制的红茶。☕</li>\n            <li>或者……只是伸个大大的懒腰发发呆？</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 15px; text-align: right;\">\n    <span style=\"background: #ffecb3; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; color: #ff8f00; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">\n        状态：元气满满中！☀️\n    </span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 10px;\">\n    <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/爬行\" width=\"120\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; filter: drop-shadow(2px 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1));\">\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999; margin-top: 10px;\">\n    主人要不要粽子陪您一起去晒晒太阳呀？(*/ω＼*)\n</div>\n\n</div>",
